---
// 图：NVIDIA / 昇腾双泳道的剪枝生产链路：剪 → 调 → 导出 → 逐层验证
---

<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 252" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs>
      <marker id="prt-arw" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3 L0,6 Z" fill="#94a3b8"/></marker>
    </defs>
    <g font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">
      <text x="320" y="22" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#0c5f74" text-anchor="middle">2:4 稀疏的生产链路：剪出来不算数，逐层验证过才加速</text>

      {/* 顶部四阶段 */}
      {["① 剪：生成 2:4 掩码","② 调：微调恢复精度","③ 导：编译进引擎","④ 验：逐层核对 tactic"].map((t,i)=>(
        <g>
          <rect x={30+i*150} y="42" width="136" height="30" rx="7" fill="#f4f6f8" stroke="#cbd5e1"/>
          <text x={98+i*150} y="61" font-size="9" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">{t}</text>
          {i<3 && <line x1={166+i*150} y1="57" x2={176+i*150} y2="57" stroke="#94a3b8" marker-end="url(#prt-arw)"/>}
        </g>
      ))}

      {/* NVIDIA 泳道 */}
      <rect x="20" y="92" width="600" height="64" rx="10" fill="#f2fafd" stroke="#7fc3d8"/>
      <text x="34" y="114" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#006377">NVIDIA</text>
      <text x="120" y="114" font-size="9" fill="#006377">ASP / ModelOpt（sparse24）</text>
      <text x="120" y="138" font-size="9" fill="#475569">原超参微调，或 SparseGPT/Wanda 式 one-shot</text>
      <line x1="268" y1="124" x2="292" y2="124" stroke="#94a3b8" marker-end="url(#prt-arw)"/>
      <text x="360" y="114" font-size="9" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">短微调（ASP）</text>
      <text x="360" y="138" font-size="9" fill="#475569" text-anchor="middle">—</text>
      <line x1="418" y1="124" x2="442" y2="124" stroke="#94a3b8" marker-end="url(#prt-arw)"/>
      <text x="500" y="114" font-size="9" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">TensorRT kSPARSE_WEIGHTS</text>
      <text x="500" y="138" font-size="9" fill="#475569" text-anchor="middle">TRT-LLM / vLLM（Sparse-Marlin）</text>

      {/* 昇腾泳道 */}
      <rect x="20" y="168" width="600" height="64" rx="10" fill="#f2fbf7" stroke="#7fd4ae"/>
      <text x="34" y="190" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0a7a50">昇腾</text>
      <text x="120" y="190" font-size="9" fill="#0a7a50">AMCT「4 选 2」结构化稀疏</text>
      <text x="120" y="214" font-size="9" fill="#475569">每 4 个权重保 2 个最大幅值</text>
      <line x1="268" y1="200" x2="292" y2="200" stroke="#94a3b8" marker-end="url(#prt-arw)"/>
      <text x="360" y="190" font-size="9" fill="#0a7a50" text-anchor="middle">微调恢复</text>
      <text x="360" y="214" font-size="9" fill="#475569" text-anchor="middle">Atlas A2 训练系列</text>
      <line x1="418" y1="200" x2="442" y2="200" stroke="#94a3b8" marker-end="url(#prt-arw)"/>
      <text x="500" y="190" font-size="9" fill="#0a7a50" text-anchor="middle">ATC 转换（--sparsity 开关）</text>
      <text x="500" y="214" font-size="9" fill="#475569" text-anchor="middle">具体开关以 CANN 版本文档为准</text>

      <text x="320" y="246" font-size="9" fill="#b14a4a" text-anchor="middle">注意：不满足 K/N 对齐倍数的层会静默回退 dense——必须用 detailed profiling 逐层确认</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</figure>
